-- title:
--   Invariance of Λ^β under right multiplication by widehatΛ^×
-- statement:
--   Let $D$ be a ring equipped with a $\mathbb{Q}$-algebra structure and let $\Lambda$ be a $\mathbb{Z}$-submodule of $D$ that contains $1$ and satisfies $xy \in \Lambda$ for all $x, y \in \Lambda$. Write $\widehat{D} = D \otimes_{\mathbb{Q}} \mathrm{FiniteAdeleRing}(\mathcal{O}_{\mathbb{Q}}, \mathbb{Q})$, and let $\widehat{\Lambda} =$ [`Submodule.finiteAdeleBox Λ`](def/Submodule_FiniteAdeleBox.html#L14) be the additive subgroup of $\widehat{D}$ generated by the elements $z \otimes a$ with $z \in \Lambda$ and $a$ a finite adele whose component at every height-one prime $v$ of $\mathcal{O}_{\mathbb{Q}}$ lies in the valuation ring of the $v$-adic completion. For a unit $g \in \widehat{D}^{\times}$, [`Submodule.conjByFiniteIdele Λ g`](def/Submodule_FiniteAdeleBox.html#L31) is the $\mathbb{Z}$-submodule of $D$ obtained by pulling back, along $z \mapsto z \otimes 1$, the image of $\widehat{\Lambda}$ under $x \mapsto g x g^{-1}$; thus it is $D \cap g\widehat{\Lambda}g^{-1}$. Given units $\beta, \mu \in \widehat{D}^{\times}$ with $\mu$ in [`Submodule.finiteIdeleStabilizer Λ`](def/Submodule_FiniteAdeleBox.html#L26), i.e. $\mu$ stabilises the underlying set of $\widehat{\Lambda}$ for the multiplicative action of $\widehat{D}^{\times}$ on $\widehat{D}$, the conclusion is the equality of $\mathbb{Z}$-submodules [`Submodule.conjByFiniteIdele Λ (β * μ) = Submodule.conjByFiniteIdele Λ β`](def/Submodule_FiniteAdeleBox.html#L31).
--
--   This is the statement that the conjugate order $\Lambda^{\beta} = D \cap \beta\widehat{\Lambda}\beta^{-1}$ depends only on the coset $\beta\widehat{\Lambda}^{\times}$, so that $\beta \mapsto \Lambda^{\beta}$ is well defined on $\widehat{D}^{\times}/\widehat{\Lambda}^{\times}$. It is used in the Čerednik–Drinfel'd tower material, where Hecke operators move the idele $\beta$ only up to the stabiliser of the level and the resulting Eichler order must be unchanged.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_Submodule_conjByFiniteIdele_mul_eq_of_mem_finiteIdeleStabilizer.lean

